BRAINSTORM: Possible Topics
After replicating DCD on IOI/gpt2, does cluster structure recover IOI prompt-type variants (ABBA, BABA, filler, letter, passive, 3-person) the way the paper’s GPT-2 all-task / single-task mixes suggest?
On balanced parentheses: do 1-closing vs 4-closing examples land in different attribution clusters / circuits, measured by edge Jaccard and cross-cluster faithfulness drop?
Does syntactic context (print/str vs tuple, etc.) induce distinct circuits even when the human label is still “close the parentheses”?
Would larger models (Qwen2.5-7B, Llama-3.1-8B) show the same parentheses multi-circuit pattern as GPT-2, or fewer/more clusters?
Later optional bridge to the secure-code group: do insecure vs secure generations use different circuits — only after parentheses results exist?

